        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=4$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x+6+2x+12&=30\\\\3x+18&=30\\\\3x&=12\\\\x&=4\\end{align*}$$\nCheck: $4+6+2(4)+12=30$.",
